# Product Design Case Studies

# RMS — Remote Monitoring System

## Overview

RMS is an enterprise-grade remote monitoring platform designed to monitor and manage EV charging infrastructure operations in real time.

---

## Problem

EV operators faced multiple operational challenges:

* No centralized monitoring system
* Delayed fault detection
* Lack of real-time charger visibility
* Difficulty managing charger uptime
* Complex operational workflows
* Poor visibility into charger health and alerts

---

## Solution

Designed a scalable monitoring system that enabled:

* Real-time charger monitoring
* Live operational dashboards
* Fault and alert management
* Charger health visibility
* Centralized operational control
* Scalable enterprise workflows

---

## Information Architecture

```text
RMS
│
├── Dashboard
├── Charger Monitoring
│   ├── Live Status
│   ├── Charger Health
│   ├── Faults
│   └── Alerts
│
├── Operations
│   ├── Monitoring
│   ├── Diagnostics
│   └── Remote Actions
│
├── Reports
├── Notifications
└── Settings
```

---

## Key Contributions

* Enterprise dashboard design
* Monitoring workflows
* Alert management UX
* Charger operational visibility
* Scalable information architecture
* Real-time data visualization

---

## AI Assisted Workflow

Used AI tools including Cursor and Antigravity to accelerate:

* Rapid prototyping
* Interaction flow generation
* Frontend prototype exploration
* UX iteration workflows

